---
import ItemPage from '../../layouts/ItemPage.astro';
import { CAKE_SIZES } from '../../data/cakes';

const faqs = [
  { q: 'How much is a Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake?', a: 'A 10-inch Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake typically costs about $35.99. Prices vary by location.' },
  { q: 'How many people does a Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake serve?', a: 'About 12 to 16 people.' },
  { q: 'What is in a Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake?', a: 'Soft serve blended with chocolate chip cookie dough pieces, the fudge and cookie crunch center, and whipped icing.' },
  { q: 'Is the Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake cheaper than the Oreo cake?', a: 'Yes, by about $2.75 at typical prices.' },
];
---
<ItemPage
  title="DQ Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake: Price & Servings"
  description="The Dairy Queen Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake costs about $35.99 for a 10-inch cake serving 12–16. What is in it, how to order and how it compares."
  name="Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake"
  category={{ name: 'DQ Cakes', href: '/categories/dq-cakes' }}
  image="/Images/cookie-dough-blizzard-cake.webp"
  imageAlt="Dairy Queen Cookie Dough Blizzard ice cream cake"
  badges={['Serves 12–16']}
  quick="A 10-inch Cookie Dough Blizzard Cake from Dairy Queen costs about $35.99 and serves 12 to 16 people. Order a day or two ahead if your store does not have one in the freezer. Prices vary by location."
  from="From $35.99"
  intro="This cake turns the Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough Blizzard into a party cake: soft cookie dough pieces through the soft serve, with the classic fudge and crunch layer in the middle."
  spec={[
    ['Price', '$35.99+ (10-inch)'],
    ['Serves', '12–16 people'],
    ['Inside', 'Soft serve with cookie dough pieces, fudge and cookie crunch center'],
    ['Lead time', '24–48 hours if not in stock'],
  ]}
  allergens="Milk, Wheat, Soy, Eggs"
  table={{ title: 'Compare DQ cake sizes and prices', ...CAKE_SIZES }}
  faqs={faqs}
>
  <h2>Cookie Dough or Oreo?</h2>
  <p>The Cookie Dough cake is softer and sweeter; the <a href="/items/oreo-blizzard-cake">Oreo Blizzard Cake</a> is crunchier and a bit more popular. The cookie dough version usually costs about $2.75 less. If you love the <a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard">Cookie Dough Blizzard</a>, you will love this cake.</p>

  <h2>How to order</h2>
  <p>Check the freezer case first. If your store does not have one, order by phone or in store 24 to 48 hours ahead, and add a message if you want one. Keep it frozen until 10 to 15 minutes before serving.</p>

  <p>For every size and price, see the <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ cake prices page</a>, and for cutting and storage tips, our <a href="/blog/dq-cakes-complete-guide">DQ cake serving guide</a>.</p>
</ItemPage>
